BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Day as we explore the life and legacy of unsun
 g hero Stewart Udall\, one of America's most effective environmentalists 
 in his role as Secretary of the Interior protecting our shared natural he
 ritage and beauty.  Presented by Grand County Public Library and Canyonla
